        {
            "title": "由AI選出的AI科技股已飆升+94%，仍具+52%上漲空間",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"由AI選出的AI科技股已飆升+94%，仍具+52%上漲空間\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d6de6179ce71e34cce262f35822440c587e456c2477fbdd57ac8b9ead94919c9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA5I05A_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">由AI選出的AI科技股已飆升+94%，仍具+52%上漲空間</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com —</strong> 科技股的強勁漲勢正遭遇波動壁壘，AI交易出現明顯分化，資金從估值過高的硬件股轉向企業軟件板塊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">然而，在劇烈震盪取代穩健升勢之際，精明資金依然專注於挖掘隱藏價值。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">已訂閱InvestingPro的會員（<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"每月低至不足8美元\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:每月低至不足8美元;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/pro/pricing?paywall=propicks?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>每月低至不足8美元</strong></a>，限時閃購優惠）已提前佈局多家高確信度公司，這些公司目前以大幅折讓於內在價值的價格交易。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">就在昨日，軟件股強勁反彈，<strong>高德納公司（Gartner Inc (NYSE: IT)）</strong>大漲<strong>+9.74%</strong>，<strong>飛塔網絡（Fortinet Inc (NASDAQ: FTNT)）</strong>上漲<strong>+9.04%</strong>，機構資金在企業重新調整AI支出之際重新流入諮詢服務及網絡安全板塊。而<strong>Everforth Inc (NYSE: EFOR)</strong>更再度躍升<strong>+8.20%</strong>，自7月首次被我們的模型選中以來，累計漲幅已達<strong>+93.91%</strong>。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-c9a8a749-37cd-3f2c-a2ad-ed36e5b6bf0f-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">InvestingPro旗艦產品ProPicks AI每月提供一份由人工智能驅動的高確信度選股名單，整合逾150項基本面指標，並針對實時市場狀況進行動態優化。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">結合InvestingPro的公允價值數據——匯聚17種機構級估值模型——高級會員可獲取數十隻優質股票的選股資訊，這些股票的交易價格較估計公允價值低達75%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">分析結果揭示了多家被市場忽視、估值嚴重偏低的企業，儘管科技板塊整體正在輪動。以下是系統標記的深度低估標的預覽：</p><ul class=\"mb-module-gap\"><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Everforth (NYSE:EFOR)：</strong>公允價值上漲空間達<strong>+51.9%</strong><em>（詳見下方精選聚焦）</em></p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>【鎖定 旅遊巨頭】：</strong>公允價值上漲空間<strong>+50.6%</strong><em>（僅限InvestingPro會員查看）</em></p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p clas